  "rulesNote": "Rules are tried in order, patterns anchored to the whole faculty name: the first whose faculty pattern matches the handbook's faculty (and whose title pattern, if any, matches that part of the degree's title) gives the colour. Checked against all 444 courses of the 2027 handbook (26 Sep 2026). Assumed, approved 26 Sep 2026: Arts and Social Sciences degrees take Communication's colour, or Education's when the title says Education; TD School takes Transdisciplinary; Graduate School of Health takes Health.",
